ine consistent</p>\n          <div class=\"vp-benefit-row\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5\"/></svg>\n            <span>21-day calendar with morning, evening, and deep clean logs</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"vp-benefit-row\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5\"/></svg>\n            <span>Weekly wipe check to monitor plaque reduction progress</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"vp-benefit-row\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5\"/></svg>\n            <span>Before and after photo slots to see the difference clearly</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"vp-benefit-row\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5\"/></svg>\n            <span>Breath progress log from week 1 through week 4</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"vp-free-tag\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07-1.916V6.75\"/></svg>\n            Delivered instantly after checkout\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  function vpOpen() {\n    document.getElementById('vp-overlay').classList.add('is-open');\n    document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n  }\n\n  function vpClose() {\n    document.getElementById('vp-overlay').classList.remove('is-open');\n    document.body.style.overflow = '';\n  }\n\n  function vpOverlayClick(e) {\n    if (e.target === document.getElementById('vp-overlay')) vpClose();\n  }\n\n  function vpTab(index) {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.vp-tab-btn').forEach(function(t, i) {\n      t.classList.toggle('is-active', i === index);\n    });\n    document.querySelectorAll('.vp-panel').forEach(function(p, i) {\n      p.classList.toggle('is-active', i === index);\n    });\n  }\n\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e) {\n    if (e.key === 'Escape') vpClose();\n  });\n</script>"
