        "heading_YKVyXP": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why Plaque<strong> Keeps Getting Worse</strong>",
            "title_highlight_color": "#47b5e9",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_Kdzny8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Most owners try dental treats, powders, or water additives. But the plaque keeps building up...</p><p><br/><strong>Here's the problem: most solutions only clean the surface</strong>. They can't remove the bacterial plaque before it hardens into tartar.</p><p><br/>Treats? Dogs bite and swallow—<strong>they don't scrub.</strong> Powders and liquids? <strong>They can't physically remove plaque.</strong><br/></p><p>FreshWipes work differently. The textured surface physically scrubs plaque off. Antibacterial ingredients prevent regrowth.<br/><strong>30 seconds a day</strong> removes bacteria at the source. No bacteria, no plaque.<br/></p><p>Requires daily use for best results.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
