        "text_EgwQE8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Veterinary cleaning for tartar can cost thousands of dollars and often requires anesthesia.</p><p>FreshWipes cost a fraction – and are completely risk-free to use</p><p>For us, it’s not about making money – it's about helping dogs feel better.</p><h4><strong>Gentle. Safe. Developed for your dog.</strong></h4><p>Our wipes are fragrance-free, pH-balanced, and designed for safe use in the mouth.</p><p>They fit all dog breeds and are easy to bring on walks, trips, or holidays.</p><p><strong>Dental care should never be a barrier.</strong></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
